VISUAL: Maintainerr "Rules" page displaying various predefined rules like "Stale Movies," "Never-Played Requests," and "Leaving Soon."
AUDIO: 'a year ago, never requested, unwatched in 90 days, or shows nobody finished the first season of. Rules can nest with and and or logic. So, keep anything my wife rated four stars fits right next to'

