AUDIO: 'politely announces its own house cleaning, and anyone who cares can hit play before the clock runs out. It\'s the office fridge note automated. That grace period is doing quiet diplomatic work.'

[03:46] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'Every shared server admin knows the conversation that starts with, where did my show go? Maintainer\'s answer is structural. It was in the leaving soon collection for 30 days. It had a banner on the poster and nobody press play. The deletion'

